<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves up at $1.466 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves up at $1.466 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange reserves edged up to $1.466 billion on December 12 from $1.423 billion a week earlier, against $1.895 billion on December 14 last year, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Following is the weekly forex reserves position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (MLN DLRS)		DEC 12     DEC 5	DEC 14, 1995</p>
<p>    TOTAL		     1,466	1,423	1,895</p>
<p>    Forex in Pakistan	 421	  456	  540</p>
<p>    Forex outside Pakistan  367	  289	  648</p>
<p>    Gold coins and bullion  676	  676	  707</p>
<p>    Special Drawing Rights    2	    2	    0.4</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
